      en: ["Name refers to now locally extinct dugongs", "Located off the coast of Grand Anse district", "Important nesting site for roseate terns", "Consists primarily of weathered granite rocks", "Surrounded by shallow coral reef systems", "Uninhabited and strictly protected for wildlife"],
